  "instance_name": "selective_tolerance",
  "label": "Selective Tolerance",
  "description": "The practice of applying tolerance inconsistently, often favoring one’s own group or beliefs while being intolerant of others. This is a social and political concept that the meme critiques by juxtaposing the aggressive display of intolerance with the expectation of tolerance for one’s own religion. It reflects real-world debates about fairness, equity, and the limits of religious freedom.",
